  "scope": "Offered QPS is a mean arrival rate,not simultaneous batch size. Realized rate uses (N-1)/(last-first scheduled arrival). Window counts include the current arrival. Identical scheduled offsets do not guarantee identical coordinator enqueue delays. Per-request queue/burst associations are descriptive. There is no intervention on burstiness or proof of a causal percentage. Natural output work can differ. A QPS2 finite cohort does not establish sustainable capacity."
